- Audit/report/plan/log bot → `/home/ndaruls/Workspace/konter-print-helper-history/` (bukan root Workspace).
- Setelah ubah folder history / INDEX Workspace: `cd /home/ndaruls/Workspace && graphify update . --force` (output di `_meta/graphify-out/`).

